\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The permutohedral route complex of $\{2,3,8,9\}$ at $m=72$ (exact; projection of a $3$-dimensional polytope to the plane, front and back views).} Filled blue dots are admissible arrangements, hollow dots are inadmissible; solid blue lines are legal swaps and dotted grey lines are non-legal exchanges; green faces are the four $2$-faces (squares and hexagons) all of whose vertices are admissible. The unfilled cycle of legal swaps is the generator of $H_1=\mathbb  F_2$. The picture is a projection; the object is the $3$-dimensional permutohedron's boundary $S^2$. Theorems illustrated: \cref  {thm:sphere}, \cref  {ex:loop}.}}{26}{figure.12}\protected@file@percent }
